  "implementation": [
    "The resident/JIT shared BorrowedNumericOperand selects a synchronous immutable Core typed slice once for exact Bool/Index/U8/U16/U32/U64/U128/I8/I16/I32/I64/I128/F32/F64 schema/backing pairs. Scalars borrow one element; canonical matrices remain row-major and mixed dense F64 transport keeps its original column-major mapping.",
    "Broadcast arithmetic, numeric unary operations, transpose and ordered sums reuse the operand views. Per-cell generic ValueData construction and repeated schema-directed draft conversion disappear for the exact selected kinds. Existing arithmetic, reduction order, typed constructors, publication and error paths are reused unchanged.",
    "Every current input/schema/shape check and complete original staging, output, clone, temporary, node, comparison and compute admission remains before the source loan. No owner, value, pointer, permit or partially produced output is cached across calls, no unchecked read is introduced, and bounds errors remain checked.",
    "Constrained integer, composite, String and mismatched schema/backing pairs retain the exact Core conversion. A maintained test-only ablation disables both typed input and output routes and compares actual old/new values, errors, finite denials and recovery.",
    "IR375 and Work144 identify the typed operand runtime while retaining the original full prices. Both established exact Huffman work equations remain unchanged. No benchmark port, source arithmetic, reassociation or FMA changes."
  ],
  "development_checks": {
    "focused_tests": {
      "passed": 7,
      "log_sha256": "9c6b50805d53d7a2116fd782f6694de242f19a77f7a70129236040cc8d5220bb",
      "scope": "All14 exact scalar/matrix kinds, empty axes, signed-zero/NaN/infinity bits, both scalar broadcast sides and all six arithmetic operations, ordered sums and failures, finite denials, prior output preservation, recovery, constrained/composite fallback and mismatched schema rejection."
    },
    "selection": "All15 optimization programs receive one seven-sample replay against the frozen round15 compiler. Any largest >5% training regression may receive one fixed follow-up of six alternating pairs with31 samples each, retaining all flags and without source or binary changes. No current holdout timing/profile occurs before freeze."
  },
